{"title": "Romance", "pageid": 815, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Romance", "categories": ["Party interactions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<span class=\"nomobile\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><video src=\"https://bg3.wiki/w/images/1/15/Wyll_Romance.webm\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" class=\"mw-file-element\" style=\"max-width: 100%; width: 300px; height: auto;\" autoplay=\"\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"1\"><a href=\"https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Wyll_Romance.webm\">https://bg3.wiki/wiki/File:Wyll_Romance.webm</a></video><figcaption>Wyll romance</figcaption></figure></span>\n<p><b>Romance</b> is an optional feature in <i>Baldur's Gate 3</i>. The player character can pursue romantic relationships with several companions, ranging from brief flings to long-term commitments. They can also engage in separate trysts with other non-companion characters throughout the game.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r356266\">.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{display:grid;margin:10px 4px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{padding:8px 16px;margin:auto}@media screen and (max-width:779px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-top:10px;padding:8px 2px;border-left:0!important;grid-row:2;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:3;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote{justify-content:center!important}}@media screen and (min-width:780px){.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left{margin-left:10px;border-left:2px solid #3d3d3d!important;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-right{margin-right:10px;border-left:0!important;border-right:2px solid #3d3d3d;grid-row:1;grid-column:2}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-right{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:3}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left{margin:auto 0;grid-row:1;grid-column:1}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{grid-row:2;grid-column:2}}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author{margin-left:auto;margin-right:32px;font-size:smaller;font-weight:bold}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{font-size:300%;font-family:serif;color:#3d3d3d;line-height:1em}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin{margin-bottom:auto;margin-right:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end{margin-top:auto;margin-left:8px}.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text{font-style:italic}</style><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/70px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/105px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/140px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/70px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">Love is no domain of mine. But it is often cited as the purpose of mortal life. Wherefore turnst thou from it?</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a>, when spoken to by a character not in a romance</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p><br><br>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p>Some relationships can find their peak in sexual scenes, while others follow different paths. Characters can show interest in the player character regardless of race and gender. More significant relationships occur only with <a href=\"/wiki/Companion\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Companion\">Companions</a>. Romance is available in multiplayer, but player characters cannot start a romance with each other. All romances are available to any <a href=\"/wiki/Custom\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Custom\">Custom</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Origin\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Origin\">Origin</a> player characters and some Origin player characters have unique dialogue options during romance.\n</p><p>It is possible to be in a relationship with any of the Origin companions, as well as Halsin or Minthara. Neither Jaheira nor Minsc can be romanced. While Shadowheart, Astarion and Karlach may permit the player character to add Halsin (if asked), other characters do not consent to being in a <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin/Romance#Romancing_Other_Characters\" title=\"Halsin/Romance\">committed</a> polyamorous relationship.\n</p><p>Although a player character can initiate romance with up to two origin companions, only one can be maintained in later stages; one of the romanced origin companions eventually forces the player character to choose between them. Though they may mention the idea with certain conversations, companions do not initiate polyamory on their own with other companions. If a romance progresses sufficiently, kissing animations may become available.<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r356266\"><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote\" style=\"justify-content: center\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-image-left\" style=\"display: inline-block; height: calc(70px + 2*4px); width: calc(70px + 2*4px); clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%); background: black;\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; margin: 4px; width: 70px; height: 70px; clip-path: polygon(50% 0%, 100% 50%, 50% 100%, 0% 50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/70px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/105px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/140px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/70px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><blockquote style=\"font-size: 100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-blockquote-left\">\n  <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center\">\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-begin\">“</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-text\">...I am but one of your lovers. You and I should seek happiness, wherever it lies. You are all I want, but I will not hoard you to myself. Let others know the happiness of being with you.</div>\n     <div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-end\">„</div>\n  </div>\n</blockquote><div class=\"bg3wiki-fancy-quote-author\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Halsin\" title=\"Halsin\">Halsin</a>, on his willingness to share a romanced player character with that of another</div><div style=\"grid-column:3\"></div></div>\n<p><br>\nNormally, a player character may initiate the beginning stages of romance with up to two origin companions only. However, the <a href=\"/wiki/Tiefling_Refugee_Celebration\" title=\"Tiefling Refugee Celebration\">Tiefling Refugee Celebration</a> (if and after the party save the <a href=\"/wiki/Emerald_Grove\" title=\"Emerald Grove\">Emerald Grove</a> in Act One) operates on unique script triggers, and can bypass standard relationship checks at this event. Thus far, two unusual possibilities have been noted at the celebration as a result of these unique script triggers.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Celebration_romance_choices.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Celebration_romance_choices.png/300px-Celebration_romance_choices.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Celebration_romance_choices.png/450px-Celebration_romance_choices.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Celebration_romance_choices.png/600px-Celebration_romance_choices.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"A picture of the player character at the conclusion of the Tiefling Refugee Celebration. In this case they have four companions to choose from.\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Celebration_romance_choices.png/300px-Celebration_romance_choices.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Celebration_romance_choices.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The player character can arrange several romance choices at the conclusion of the Tiefling Refugee Celebration.</figcaption></figure>\n<ol><li>If the player character previously declined a romance offered by Astarion, they may get <a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/Romance#Another_chance_to_connect\" title=\"Astarion/Romance\">another chance</a> here.</li>\n<li>If the player character queues two romances the same day, prior to the long rest which starts the celebration, they can sneak in a third romance at the festivities.<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> To illustrate, the player character can ask to <a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart/Romance#Another_way_to_connect\" title=\"Shadowheart/Romance\">'truly connect'</a> with Shadowheart and – immediately after – approach Lae'zel to hear out and accept <a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel/Romance#Manually_starting_a_romance\" title=\"Lae'zel/Romance\">her proposition</a> as well. Then, at the night celebration, as long as the player character has not yet had an evening romance cut-scene with either of these companions, they may start a third romance here. <i>To be clear: the first two romances must be started </i>before<i> long resting and the night celebration begins, though in this case – if one wants Shadowheart to be included in this trio of budding romances – the player character must start a romance with her first, as the 'truly connect' dialogue option with Shadowheart only works if the player character is not in a relationship with any companion and has not yet approached any of them (e.g., Gale's <a href=\"/wiki/Gale/Romance#Act_One\" title=\"Gale/Romance\">'Weave' cut-scene</a>).</i> After the first two romances are queued to begin, when the night celebration starts, the player character may approach a third companion (such as <a href=\"/wiki/Karlach/Romance#Visiting_the_player_character_at_night\" title=\"Karlach/Romance\">Karlach</a>) and agree to meet with them later in the evening; the remaining queued romance scenes (and their progressions) can still proceed with subsequent long rests. However, if one wants to start a romance with three companions, it is recommended to take several consecutive long rests (for example, with <a href=\"/wiki/Resting#Partial_rest\" title=\"Resting\">partial rests</a> to avoid using <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Supplies#Camp_Supplies\" title=\"Camp Supplies\">camp supplies</a>) after the tiefling celebration to avoid the possibility of losing any queued romance cut-scenes to other high priority camp events (e.g., by transitioning to the <a href=\"/wiki/Rosymorn_Monastery_Trail\" title=\"Rosymorn Monastery Trail\">Rosymorn Monastery Trail</a> or the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Lands\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Lands\">Shadow-Cursed Lands</a>).</li></ol>\n<p>While the player character is in a relationship with one or more companions and is travelling (or has just left camp) they may hear other party members comment or banter on the relationship in some way, if the romanced companion is present. The content of these conversations vary depending on the makeup of the party, the events that have transpired and the companion being romanced. Also, while in camp, conversations with other companions may adjust if the player character is in a relationship, and as it progresses.  \n</p><p>As stated earlier above, there are also some sexual encounters the player character can initiate with characters who are not companions. Unlike companions they have no romance progression, but engaging in them may impact ongoing companion romances.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Romance_options\">Romance options</span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Origin_Companions\">Origin Companions</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines center\" style=\"max-width: 774px;margin: auto;\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/Romance\" title=\"Astarion's Romance High Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/120px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/180px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/240px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Astarion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png/120px-Portrait_Astarion.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Portrait_Astarion.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Astarion/Romance\" title=\"Astarion/Romance\">Astarion's Romance</a></big><br><a href=\"/wiki/High_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Elf\">High Elf</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale/Romance\" title=\"Gale's Romance Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/120px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/180px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/240px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/120px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Gale/Romance\" title=\"Gale/Romance\">Gale's<br>Romance</a></big><br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach/Romance\" title=\"Karlach's Romance Zariel Tiefling\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/120px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/180px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/240px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Karlach\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png/120px-Portrait_Karlach.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Portrait_Karlach.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Karlach/Romance\" title=\"Karlach/Romance\">Karlach's Romance</a></big><br><a href=\"/wiki/Zariel_Tiefling\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Zariel Tiefling\">Zariel Tiefling</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel/Romance\" title=\"Lae'zel's Romance[3] Githyanki\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/120px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/180px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/240px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lae'zel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png/120px-Portrait_Lae%27zel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/86/Portrait_Lae%27zel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Lae%27zel/Romance\" title=\"Lae'zel/Romance\">Lae'zel's Romance</a></big><sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br><a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Githyanki</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart/Romance\" title=\"Shadowheart's Romance High Half-Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/120px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/180px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/240px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shadowheart\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png/120px-Portrait_Shadowheart.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7e/Portrait_Shadowheart.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Shadowheart/Romance\" title=\"Shadowheart/Romance\">Shadowheart's Romance</a></big><br><a href=\"/wiki/High_Half-Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"High Half-Elf\">High Half-Elf</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll/Romance\" title=\"Wyll's Romance Human\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/120px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/179px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/239px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/120px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll/Romance\" title=\"Wyll/Romance\">Wyll's<br>Romance</a></big><br><a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Non-Origin_Companions\">Non-Origin Companions</span></h3>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-nolines center\" style=\"max-width: 774px;margin: auto;\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin/Romance\" title=\"Halsin's Romance Wood Elf\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/120px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/180px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/240px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halsin\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png/120px-Portrait_Halsin.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Portrait_Halsin.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Halsin/Romance\" title=\"Halsin/Romance\">Halsin's Romance</a></big><br><a href=\"/wiki/Wood_Elf\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wood Elf\">Wood Elf</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Minthara/Romance\" title=\"Minthara's Romance Lolth-Sworn Drow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/120px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/180px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/240px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Minthara\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8e/Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png/120px-Portrait_Minthara_%28263%29.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/