f=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith/Romance\" title=\"Nym Orlith's Romance[7] Drow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/120px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Nym Orlith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png/120px-Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Nym_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Nym_Orlith/Romance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Nym Orlith/Romance\">Nym Orlith's Romance</a></big><sup id=\"cite_ref-twins_7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-twins-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br><a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith/Romance\" title=\"Sorn Orlith's Romance[7] Drow\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/120px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp, /w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Sorn Orlith\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png/120px-Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0f/Portrait_Sorn_Orlith.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/Sorn_Orlith/Romance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sorn Orlith/Romance\">Sorn Orlith's Romance</a></big><sup id=\"cite_ref-twins_7-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-twins-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br><a href=\"/wiki/Drow\" title=\"Drow\">Drow</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 125px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 120px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor/Romance\" title=\"The Emperor's Romance[8] Mind Flayer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/120px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp, /w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Emperor\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png/120px-Portrait_The_Emperor.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c6/Portrait_The_Emperor.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"><big><a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor/Romance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"The Emperor/Romance\">The Emperor's Romance</a></big><sup id=\"cite_ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br><a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">Mind Flayer</a></div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dark_Urge_specific_scenes\">Dark Urge specific scenes</span></h2>\n<p>The following scenes are only available if the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" title=\"Dark Urge\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/38px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/50px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dark Urge\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png/25px-Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Portrait_The_Dark_Urge.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Urge\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Dark Urge\">Dark Urge</a> is chosen as origin character.\n</p>\n<ul><li>It is possible to snap Minthara's neck after having sex with her in Act 1.</li>\n<li>If <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/38px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/50px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Isobel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png/25px-Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/Portrait_Isobel_Thorm.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Isobel_Thorm\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Isobel Thorm\">Isobel</a> is not killed, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sceleritas_Fel\" title=\"Sceleritas Fel\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/25px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/38px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/50px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sceleritas Fel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png/25px-Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c3/Portrait_Sceleritas_Fel.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sceleritas_Fel\" title=\"Sceleritas Fel\">Sceleritas Fel</a> eventually tries to force the player character to kill the companion closest to them, usually their love interest.<sup id=\"cite_ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> If that companion is not woken up, they will be dead in the morning, presumably killed in a manner not unlike that of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/38px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/50px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Alfira\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png/25px-Portrait_Alfira.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/42/Portrait_Alfira.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Alfira\" title=\"Alfira\">Alfira</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quil\" title=\"Quil\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/38px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/50px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quil\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png/25px-Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/15/Portrait_Quil_Grootslang.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quil\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Quil\">Quil</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Achievements\">Achievements</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/c/c4/A-Hot_Date.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/A-Hot_Date.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Hot Date</dt>\n<dd>Go on a date with Karlach - now that's playing with fire.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; width: 100%; min-width: 10em; max-width: 45em; align-items: center; padding: 0 1em;\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"max-width: 80px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Achievements\" title=\"Achievements\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/6/6c/A-Mind_Blown.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/A-Mind_Blown.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-achievement\" style=\"margin: 0 auto 0 0; padding: 0 0.8em; text-align:left;\">\n<dl><dt>Mind Blown</dt>\n<dd>Romance the Emperor.</dd></dl>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<div class=\"notebegin\">\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r345964\">.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .refs-act1::before{content:\"Act 1\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act2::before{content:\"Act 2\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-act3::before{content:\"Act 3\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-style:italic;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-url::before{content:\"External links\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-text::before{content:\"Literature\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}.mw-parser-output .refs-note::before{content:\"Notes\";text-decoration:none;background:none;font-size:100%;font-weight:bold;direction:ltr}</style><div class=\"reflist refs-nogroup\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal;\"><div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> During actual kissing animations, worn headgear is not displayed. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> While it is technically possible to have the player character be offered four (or possibly more) romance choices before long resting, taking actions to be presented with more than three can result in the selected companion's romance cut-scene being skipped and unacknowledged the next day.<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">[<a href=\"/wiki/bg3wiki:Verification\" title=\"bg3wiki:Verification\"><span aria-label=\"When I queued up four and...\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"bg3wiki-help-tooltip\"><i>verify</i></span></a>]</sup> </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> After dealing with the Goblin-Druid Grove conflict in Act One, if the player character does not spend the night with Lae'zel she says she may do so with another: Astarion, Gale, Shadowheart or Wyll (provided they are recruited), though she speaks of such an event only on the next morning, and her possible partner does not at all. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Haarlep is under the employ of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/38px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/50px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Raphael\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png/25px-Portrait_Raphael.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Portrait_Raphael.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a>. Both are in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a> during Act Three. Having sex with Haarlep has consequences beyond those present in other romances. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Player characters can engage in a one-night stand with Mizora during Act Three, but only if Wyll is in the party. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Naoise is a courtesan at <a href=\"/wiki/Sharess%27_Caress\" title=\"Sharess' Caress\">Sharess' Caress</a>, a brothel just outside Baldur's Gate. She is on the third floor in her room, Nymph's Grotto. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-twins-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-twins_7-0\">7.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-twins_7-1\">7.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Nym and Sorn Orlith are twins and courtesans working at Sharess' Caress. The player character can pay for their services, or earn them as a reward in the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_%27Stern_Librarian%27_Ffion\" title=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_%27Stern_Librarian%27_Ffion\" title=\"Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion\">Find the 'Stern Librarian' Ffion</a>. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> After completing the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Visit_the_Emperor%27s_Old_Hideout\" title=\"Visit the Emperor's Old Hideout\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Visit the Emperor's Old Hideout\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Visit_the_Emperor%27s_Old_Hideout\" title=\"Visit the Emperor's Old Hideout\">Visit the Emperor's Old Hideout</a>, the player character can choose to have an <a href=\"/wiki/The_Emperor#Romance_2\" title=\"The Emperor\">intimate encounter</a> with the Emperor in a dream during a long rest. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> This event almost always happens for the Dark Urge unless the party resolves Act Two with minimal or no resting after Ketheric Thorm is defeated. </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Approval\" title=\"Approval\">Approval</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Dialogue\" title=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195215\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.104 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.110 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2708/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 24471/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7503/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 23/200\nExpensive parser function count: 8/750\nUn